{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","kind":"response","reasoning":"Next, let's dig deeper into the actual package structure of babylon-lite, compare it with the structure of Babylon.js, and identify the concrete differences. I'll check the following:\n1. packages/babylon-lite — the engine library\n2. docs/lite — the feature comparison docs (02-feature-comparison.md) and the porting guide (03-porting-guide.md)\n3. AGENTS.md, GUIDANCE.md — probably useful context\n\nLet's check the package structure and the feature comparison docs.\n","seq":830,"t":38985,"text":"","timings":{"cache_n":4352,"draft_n":434,"draft_n_accepted":161,"predicted_ms":2860.0,"predicted_n":223,"prompt_ms":3840.0,"prompt_n":2124},"to_request":723,"usage":{"cached_tokens":4352,"completion_tokens":223,"prompt_tokens":6476}}
