{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","kind":"response","reasoning":"Great findings:\n- Scene 18: FreeCamera + `attachFreeControl(cam, canvas, scene)` — keyboard controls exist. But what about mouse look? Let me check the FreeCamera controls — does attachFreeControl support mouse look (pointer lock)? Let me check the source.\n- Scene 40: Havok physics V2 works — `createHavokWorld`, `createPhysicsAggregate`, `PhysicsShapeType`, `onPhysicsAfterStep`, `scene.fixedDeltaMs`.\n- The physics folder has `character-controller.ts`! Perfect for FPS. Plus `havok-heightfield.ts` (terrain physics), `havok-queries.ts` (raycasts), `havok-trigger.ts`.\n- The mesh folder has `thin-instance.ts`, `csg.ts`, `csg2.ts`, `compute-normals.ts` — CSG2 with Manifold is interesting for terrain destruction!\n\nThings to check next:\n1. FreeCamera controls — mouse look / pointer lock support.\n2. character-controller.ts — API.\n3. Mesh runtime updates — can we modify vertex buffers? Check the mesh.ts API (updatePositions, etc.).\n4. Picking API — scene 113.\n5. Heightmap ground — which scene? Let me find it. \"Ground from heightmap — GPU texture → vertex displacement.\"\n\nLet me look at these.\n","seq":5236,"t":204381,"text":"\n\nGood news so far: FreeCamera with keyboard controls (scene 18), Havok V2 physics with a **character controller**, heightfield physics, and queries (scene 40), plus CSG2. Next up are the important details for FPS: mouse look, the character controller API, picking, and whether geometry can be modified at runtime.\n\n\n","timings":{"cache_n":23040,"draft_n":1008,"draft_n_accepted":364,"predicted_ms":8060.000000000001,"predicted_n":508,"prompt_ms":2650.0,"prompt_n":2563},"to_request":4962,"usage":{"cached_tokens":23040,"completion_tokens":508,"prompt_tokens":25603}}
