{"entry":{"id":"r11177/call_3e0014035cb94159a810d363/map","text":"Babylon-Lite API anchors for the FPS (all verified in packages/babylon-lite/src): player/bot controller = createPhysicsCharacterController (physics/character-controller.ts, capsule, moveWithCollisions, CharacterSupportedState); hits = createGpuPicker + createPickingRay (picking/); runtime terrain surgery = createFlatGroundData + computeNormals + uploadMeshToGPU (mesh/), meshes keep _cpuPositions/_cpuNormals copies; debris = thin-instance API (mesh/thin-instance.ts: addThinInstance/setThinInstanceMatrix/removeThinInstance); HUD = createTextLayer/createTextRenderable (text/, scenes 180-181); bots = navigation module (createNavMesh, computePath, createNavCrowd/agentGoto/updateNavCrowd, addBoxObstacle/removeObstacle — built on @recast-navigation/wasm, scenes 170-175); physics world = createHavokWorld + createHeightFieldShape, HavokPhysics.wasm served from lab/public/."},"kind":"patch","lane":"self-capture","op":"add","seq":12062,"t":481884}
