{"entry":{"id":"interview-t2-6","text":"gotcha: public API must never expose raw WebGPU handles, and public types are pure state with no methods — behavior via standalone functions, factories take no `scene`, registration is explicit `addToScene()` — IMPLICATION: new public types must be plain data + functions; GPU handles stay in internal modules only."},"fork":14669,"kind":"patch","op":"retire","seq":19437,"t":841235}
{"entry":{"id":"interview-t2-9","text":"constraint: Never parse emitted WGSL strings for structured data — the minifier rewrites them; use typed interfaces (`UboField[]`, `BindingDecl[]`) instead."},"fork":14669,"kind":"patch","op":"retire","seq":19438,"t":841235}
{"entry":{"id":"interview-t2-f3661-1","text":"constraint: 100% tree-shakable with zero module-level side effects — no code at import time (no `register*()` calls, no `globalThis` mutation, no module-level `new Map()/Set()/WeakMap()`); use lazy-init and auto-invalidate caches on device change."},"fork":14669,"kind":"patch","op":"retire","seq":19439,"t":841235}
