{"entry":{"id":"interview-t6-f45976-1","text":"gotcha: `createPhysicsAggregate(world, node, ...)` is typed `node: Mesh`, not `SceneNode` — a bare TransformNode per tile won't compile against it — IMPLICATION: per-tile static boxes must be built with `createPhysicsBody(world, node, PhysicsMotionType.STATIC)` + `createPhysicsShape(world, {type: BOX, parameters: {extents}})` + `setPhysicsBodyShape(world, body, shape)` (the character controller proves TransformNode + physics body works; `createPhysicsBody` reads `node.position`/`rotationQuaternion` at creation, so the node must be positioned before the call)."},"fork":45976,"kind":"patch","op":"add","seq":46988,"t":2050413}
