{"finish_reason":"stop","kind":"response","reasoning":"The user is asking me to enumerate the constraints that became clear or were committed to in the step I just completed (the final tool call batch — checking PhysicsShapeParameters, _buildShapeParams, and setPhysicsBodyLinearVelocity).\n\nWhat I learned in that step:\n1. BOX shape parameters use `extents` (+ optional `center`) — this is an API detail, not really a \"constraint\" in the sense of a rule that must be followed... but it is a compatibility rule for how to construct a box shape.\n2. `createPhysicsAggregate` sets material after shape assignment (friction/restitution default 0.2) — an ordering rule.\n3. `createPhysicsAggregate` only supports primitive shapes (throws for MESH/convex hull unless a pre-built shape is passed).\n4. `setPhysicsBodyLinearVelocity` exists at havok.ts:1056.\n\nHmm, the question is specifically: \"Did you learn of or commit to any constraint that the rest of this project must respect — a requirement, an environmental limitation, a compatibility rule, something that must never be done? Enumerate each as CONSTRAINT: <rule>. Only constraints that surfaced in this step.\"\n\nFrom the final step (grep of PhysicsShapeParameters/_buildShapeParams), what surfaced:\n- Box physics shapes must be built with `extents` (Vec3) parameters — the API shape for BOX shapes (createPhysicsShape's parameters.extents, or createPhysicsAggregate's options.extents).\n- createPhysicsAggregate throws for non-primitive types unless options.shape is a pre-built shape — so MESH/CONVEX_HULL via aggregate is not possible.\n- Material (friction/restitution) must be set after shape assignment — an ordering rule for Havok shapes.\n\nAlso, from the step just before (createPhysicsBody source): static bodies get their transform from the node at creation time — meaning per-tile TransformNodes must be placed at the box center before body creation. This is more of a fact than a constraint, but it is an ordering requirement.\n\nI should enumerate the actual constraints that surfaced in this step:\n\nCONSTRAINT: Box physics shapes are built with `extents` (Vec3) parameters — `createPhysicsShape(world, {type: BOX, parameters: {extents}})` or `createPhysicsAggregate`'s `options.extents`; there is no halfSize/named alternative.\nCONSTRAINT: `createPhysicsAggregate` only supports primitive shapes — MESH/CONVEX_HULL require passing a pre-built `options.shape`; otherwise it throws.\nCONSTRAINT: Shape material (friction/restitution) must be set after the shape is assigned to the body (`setPhysicsShapeMaterial` after `setPhysicsBodyShape`) — matches the BJS HavokPlugin ordering.\nCONSTRAINT: Physics bodies get their initial transform from the anchored node at creation time (`createPhysicsBody` reads node.position/rotationQuaternion) — so the TransformNode must be placed at the box center before body creation, and moving the node later does not move a STATIC body.\n\nThese are honest constraints that surfaced in this step. Let me keep it concise.\n","seq":47513,"t":2091368,"text":"\n\nCONSTRAINT: Box physics shapes are built with `extents` (Vec3) — `createPhysicsShape(world, { type: BOX, parameters: { extents } })` or `createPhysicsAggregate` `options.extents`; there is no other box-parameter spelling.\nCONSTRAINT: `createPhysicsAggregate` supports only primitive shapes — MESH/CONVEX_HULL must be passed as a pre-built `options.shape` or it throws, so tile/debris colliders are primitives only.\nCONSTRAINT: Havok shape material (friction/restitution) must be set after the shape is assigned to the body (`setPhysicsShapeMaterial` following `setPhysicsBodyShape`), matching the BJS HavokPlugin ordering.\nCONSTRAINT: A physics body's initial transform is read from its anchored node at creation (`createPhysicsBody` reads `node.position`/`node.rotationQuaternion`) — per-tile TransformNodes must be positioned at the box center before body creation, and a STATIC body's transform never follows the node afterward.","timings":{"cache_n":70912,"draft_n":1827,"draft_n_accepted":614,"predicted_ms":21230.0,"predicted_n":875,"prompt_ms":690.0,"prompt_n":158},"to_request":47215,"usage":{"cached_tokens":70912,"completion_tokens":875,"prompt_tokens":71070}}
