{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","kind":"response","reasoning":"Alright, fixing the remaining issues:\n\n1. **Player's vel.y is never reset on landing** — add contact detection: measure the actual drop amount and the requested drop amount, and if the controller was blocked → vel.y = 0. Also add a terminal velocity clamp.\n\n2. **Bot's velY has the same problem** — same fix.\n\n3. **Crosshair position** — use `window.innerWidth/innerHeight` (CSS pixels) instead of `canvas.width/height` (the canvas has a fixed 1280×720 attribute, but is stretched to 100vw/100vh via CSS, and positionPx is in CSS pixels).\n\n4. **Self-hit guard** — in tryFire, ignore terrain hits where `terr.hitDistance < 2`.\n\nApplying fix 1 (player):\n","seq":74021,"t":3698707,"text":"\n\nNow the player/bot velocity-never-resets-on-landing bug, the crosshair position, and the self-hit guard:\n\n","timings":{"cache_n":79872,"draft_n":1064,"draft_n_accepted":590,"predicted_ms":12800.0,"predicted_n":742,"prompt_ms":7340.0,"prompt_n":4879},"to_request":73775,"usage":{"cached_tokens":79872,"completion_tokens":742,"prompt_tokens":84751}}
