 spawn.\n\nLet me look at the initial player spawn.\n","seq":85759,"t":4323313,"text":"\n\nLet me check the initial player spawn and fix the spawn height to standing level (feet on ground, not floating 2 units up):\n\n","timings":{"cache_n":114688,"draft_n":1295,"draft_n_accepted":484,"predicted_ms":18490.0,"predicted_n":669,"prompt_ms":2450.0,"prompt_n":922},"to_request":85393,"usage":{"cached_tokens":114688,"completion_tokens":669,"prompt_tokens":115610}}
