{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","kind":"response","reasoning":"All helper files are in place with the correct exports. Let me verify that the exports in `fps-terrain.ts` match what `scene252.ts` imports:\n- `ARENA_SIZE` ✓\n- `TERRAIN_LAYER` ✓\n- `createFpsTerrain` ✓\n- `destroyTerrainTile` ✓\n- `terrainHeightAt` ✓\n- `tileFromPoint` ✓\n\nAnd `destroyTerrainTile` takes `(terrain, engine, world, nav, tile)` — let me verify that the call in scene252 matches. In scene252, it's called as `destroyTerrainTile(terrain, engine, world, nav, tile)`. ✓\n\nLet me re-read the entire destroyTerrainTile function in fps-terrain.ts to confirm that it uses resizeMeshGeometry (not raw uploadMeshToGPU) and handles nav obstacles.\n","seq":90476,"t":4641136,"text":"","timings":{"cache_n":125696,"draft_n":406,"draft_n_accepted":201,"predicted_ms":6890.0,"predicted_n":259,"prompt_ms":2060.0,"prompt_n":863},"to_request":90363,"usage":{"cached_tokens":125696,"completion_tokens":259,"prompt_tokens":126559}}
{"arguments":"{\"limit\": 75, \"offset\": 167, \"path\": \"~/git/reference/Babylon/Babylon-Lite/lab/lite/src/lite/fps-terrain.ts\"}","id":"call_90a3edccb792438b9daa447d","kind":"tool_call","name":"read","outcome":"ran","request":90363,"seq":90477,"shown":"Showing lines 167-207 of 207 total lines.\n\n---\n\nexport function tileFromPoint(terrain: FpsTerrain, x: number, z: number): FpsTile | null {\n    const tx = Math.floor((x + ARENA_SIZE / 2) / TILE_SIZE);\n    const tz = Math.floor((z + ARENA_SIZE / 2) / TILE_SIZE);\n    if (tx < 0 || tx >= TILE_COUNT || tz < 0 || tz >= TILE_COUNT) {\n        return null;\n    }\n    return terrain.tiles[tz * TILE_COUNT + tx]!;\n}\n\n/**\n * Destroy one tile: drop its 6 indices from the grid mesh, recompute normals, re-upload\n * in place, remove its static body, and mark the hole on the navmesh.\n */\nexport function destroyTerrainTile(terrain: FpsTerrain, engine: EngineContext, world: PhysicsWorld, nav: NavigationPlugin | null, tile: FpsTile): void {\n    if (!tile.alive) {\n        return;\n    }\n    tile.alive = false;\n    terrain.destroyedCount++;\n\n    const mesh = terrain.mesh;\n    const m = mesh as unknown as { _cpuIndices?: Uint32Array; _cpuPositions?: Float32Array; _cpuUvs?: Float32Array };\n    const old = m._cpuIndices;\n    if (!old) {\n        return;\n    }\n    const start = (tile.tz * TILE_COUNT + tile.tx) * 6;\n    const next = new Uint32Array(old.length - 6);\n    next.set(old.subarray(0, start), 0);\n    next.set(old.subarray(start + 6), start);\n    const normals = new Float32Array(computeNormals(Array.from(m._cpuPositions!), Array.from(next)));\n    resizeMeshGeometry(engine, mesh, m._cpuPositions!, normals, next, m._cpuUvs);\n\n    if (tile.body) {\n        removePhysicsBody(world, tile.body);\n        tile.body = null;\n    }\n    if (nav) {\n        tile.obstacle = addBoxObstacle(nav, { x: -ARENA_SIZE / 2 + tile.tx * TILE_SIZE + TILE_SIZE / 2, y: 0, z: -ARENA_SIZE / 2 + tile.tz * TILE_SIZE + TILE_SIZE / 2 }, { x: TILE_SIZE / 2, y: 2, z: TILE_SIZE / 2 }, 0);\n    }\n}","t":4641168,"turn":6}
