{"kind":"delta","request":91558,"seq":91776,"t":4726182,"tool_call":{"arguments":"{\"content\": \"Self-hit problem solved via muzzle offset, not layer filtering: the character controller's capsule shape is private (can't call setPhysicsShapeFilterMembershipMask on it) and its default membership is ~0 (belongs to every layer), so a physicsRaycast can never be filtered to exclude the player's own capsule. Fix: cast the bullet ray from a point MUZZLE_OFFSET (0.8) in front of the eye (outside the 0.5 capsule radius) so the ray never starts inside the player body. EYE_HEIGHT set to 0.7 (eye near head, center+0.7).\", \"field\": \"decision\"}","id":"call_1569cb1f591a4fe682afe311","index":0,"name":"update_record"}}
{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","kind":"response","reasoning":"No module-level side effects were found. Good.\n\nNow, let me record the key findings from this session and update the working set. I'll use update_record to log the following:\n1. Browser automation is not possible in this sandbox (Chrome's crashpad Mach bootstrap is denied) — verification was done via lint/typecheck + dev-server module resolution.\n2. The long-running dev server's file watcher was serving stale transforms — needed a restart after editing.\n3. Fixed bugs: rayVsCapsule's u formula + end caps, bot quaternion, velocity not being reset on landing, crosshair CSS pixels, self-hit via muzzle offset.\n\nLet me record these.\n\nActually, let me reconsider whether I should record everything. The working set already has a lot of notes. Let me record the most important new findings:\n- The muzzle offset solution for self-hits (player capsule can't be filter-masked).\n- Browser automation blocked in sandbox.\n- Dev server watcher serves stale content, needs restart.\n\nLet me record these concisely.\n","seq":91777,"t":4726184,"text":"\n\nNo module-level side effects. Let me record the key findings from this session:\n\n","timings":{"cache_n":129280,"draft_n":875,"draft_n_accepted":278,"predicted_ms":13840.0,"predicted_n":403,"prompt_ms":2680.0,"prompt_n":967},"to_request":91558,"usage":{"cached_tokens":129280,"completion_tokens":403,"prompt_tokens":130247}}
