{"finish_reason":"stop","kind":"response","reasoning":"Reflecting on the step I just completed (from compaction to the present). Let me enumerate the decisions made/confirmed/changed in this step:\n\n1. DECISION: Bullet raycast origin = muzzle offset (0.8u in front of the viewpoint) rather than the viewpoint itself — reason: the player capsule has a default `~0` filter and its shape is private (can't be masked), so a raycast starting from inside the capsule gets occluded by the player itself.\n\n2. DECISION: Set EYE_HEIGHT to 0.7 above the capsule center (realistic head height) instead of 1.5 — reason: the camera should be at head height. Self-hits are handled by the muzzle offset rather than by placing the viewpoint above the capsule.\n\n3. DECISION: Rewrite rayVsCapsule with a standard cylinder band + 2 endpoint cap sphere tests — reason: the old u formula was mathematically wrong, and it was missing hits on the caps.\n\n4. DECISION: Zero the player/bot's vel.y when the actual drop is less than half of the requested drop (contact detection via preY/postY around moveWithCollisions), and clamp to terminal velocity -30 — reason: velocity kept accumulating downward every step even while standing, so walking off a ledge started from an already high fall speed.\n\n5. DECISION: Crosshair is placed at window.innerWidth/innerHeight (CSS pixels) rather than canvas.width/height — reason: the canvas has fixed 1280×720 attributes, but CSS stretches it to the viewport, and positionPx is in CSS pixels (scene180:82).\n\n6. DECISION: Typed Debris.body as `PhysicsBody | null` with a guard, removing the `null as unknown as PhysicsBody` cast — reason: clean type-checking.\n\n7. DECISION: Bot display quaternion fixed to (0, sin(h/2), 0, cos(h/2)) — reason: the earlier qz=cos, qw=0 was a 180° rotation around a tilted axis.\n\n8. DECISION: Spawn the player at terrainHeight + CAP_HEIGHT/2 + 0.1 (feet on the ground) rather than +2 — reason: the controller's position is the capsule center, so +2 would leave the player floating 1.1u in the air.\n\n9. DECISION: Restart the dev server after editing — reason: the long-running vite server was serving stale transforms (in this sandbox the file watcher wasn't picking up changes).\n\n10. DECISION: Verification in this session = lint + typecheck + dev-server module resolution. Browser automation is not possible (Chrome SIGABRTs: crashpad's Mach bootstrap is EPERM inside the sandbox) — reason: manual playtest by the user on :5182 is the runtime gate.\n\n11. Confirmed: setThinInstances re-uploads on each call (bumps _version and sets the dirty range) — no flush is needed (resolves the unresolved item).\n\n12. Confirmed: physicsRaycast's filter can't exclude the player capsule (default membership ~0 matches any collideWith) — confirming that the muzzle offset is the correct approach.\n\n13. DECISION: fps-smoke.cjs remains at the repo root, but browser launch is impossible. Per GUIDANCE §0b, it needs to be deleted before commit (and the .smoke-tmp/.smoke-home directories too).\n\nThese are the decisions from this step. Let me write them out concisely.\n","seq":92137,"t":4757025,"text":"\n\nDECISION: Bullet raycasts originate from a muzzle point 0.8u in front of the eye, not the eye — WHY: the player capsule has default `~0` filter membership and a private shape (unmaskable), so a ray starting at the eye (inside the capsule) would be occluded by the player's own body on every shot.\nDECISION: EYE_HEIGHT = 0.7 above capsule center (head height), replacing 1.5 — WHY: 1.5 put the camera 0.6 above the head; with the muzzle offset handling self-hits, the camera can sit at a realistic eye level.\nDECISION: Rewrote `rayVsCapsule` as cylindrical-band + two end-cap sphere tests — WHY: the old `u` formula was mathematically wrong (missing valid center hits) and returned null for all cap hits.\nDECISION: Player/bot vertical velocity is zeroed when actual drop < half of requested drop after `moveWithCollisions`, with a -30 terminal clamp — WHY: `vel.y` accumulated `-g*dt` every step even while standing, so walking off a ledge started a fall at full accumulated speed.\nDECISION: Crosshair positioned via `window.innerWidth/innerHeight` (CSS px), not `canvas.width/height` — WHY: the canvas has fixed 1280×720 attributes stretched by CSS, and `positionPx` is in CSS pixels (scene180:82).\nDECISION: Bot display quaternion corrected to `(0, sin(h/2), 0, cos(h/2))` — WHY: the prior `(0, sin, cos, 0)` args encoded a 180° rotation about a tilted axis.\nDECISION: Player/bot spawn at `terrainHeight + CAP_HEIGHT/2 + 0.1` (feet on ground) — WHY: controller position is the capsule center, so the old `+2` left the player floating 1.1u.\nDECISION: `Debris.body` typed `PhysicsBody | null` with guards, dropping the `null as unknown as PhysicsBody` cast — WHY: clean typecheck without unsafe casts.\nDECISION: Restarted the dev server after edits — WHY: the long-running vite server served stale transforms (file watcher not picking up changes in this sandbox); fresh server on :5182 now serves current code.\nDECISION: Runtime verification this session is lint + typecheck + dev-server module resolution; browser automation is impossible (Chrome SIGABRTs — crashpad Mach bootstrap EPERM in sandbox) — WHY: the playtest gate falls to the user on :5182.\nDECISION (confirmed): `setThinInstances` re-uploads on every call (bumps `_version`, sets dirty range) — no separate flush needed for per-frame bot/debris matrices.\nDECISION (confirmed): collision-layer filtering cannot exclude the player capsule from raycasts (default membership `~0` matches any `collideWith`) — WHY: confirms the muzzle offset, not filter masks, is the correct self-hit fix.\nDECISION: `fps-smoke.cjs`, `.smoke-tmp/`, `.smoke-home/` are session scratch that must be deleted before commit — WHY: GUIDANCE §0b requires removing temp/debug files, and browser launch proved unviable anyway.","timings":{"cache_n":127232,"draft_n":3052,"draft_n_accepted":1040,"predicted_ms":41060.0,"predicted_n":1476,"prompt_ms":730.0,"prompt_n":264},"to_request":91585,"usage":{"cached_tokens":127232,"completion_tokens":1476,"prompt_tokens":127496}}
