{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","kind":"response","reasoning":"Everything looks coherent. Let me reconsider a few things:\n\n1. The bot spawn uses `findRandomPointAroundCircle(nav, { x: s.x, y: 0, z: s.z }, 8)` — this finds a random point on the navmesh within 8 units of the spawn corner. Then the bot's controller is created at `p` (the navmesh point) with `y: p.y + CAP_HEIGHT/2`. Wait — `p.y` is the navmesh point's y (the walkable surface height). So the bot's capsule center is at `p.y + CAP_HEIGHT/2` = surface + 0.9 = standing height. Good.\n\n2. The HUD font is loaded from `/fonts/Inter.ttf`. Let me verify that file exists in lab/public/fonts.\n\nLet me check.\n","seq":93493,"t":4983980,"text":"\n\nThe bot setup, debris, and HUD all look coherent. Let me verify the font file exists and check the final cleanup/disposal section:\n\n","timings":{"cache_n":63744,"draft_n":602,"draft_n_accepted":214,"predicted_ms":6540.0,"predicted_n":300,"prompt_ms":2860.0,"prompt_n":2069},"to_request":93330,"usage":{"cached_tokens":63744,"completion_tokens":300,"prompt_tokens":65813}}
