ade this session:**\n- `rayVsCapsule` rewritten (cylindrical band + end caps) — the old `u` formula was wrong and missed cap hits\n- Bot display quaternion corrected to a proper Y-heading `(0, sin(h/2), 0, cos(h/2))`\n- Self-hit solved via a **muzzle offset** (0.8u in front of the eye) — the player capsule can't be filter-masked (private shape, default `~0` membership), so the ray simply never starts inside it\n- Eye height 0.7 (above capsule center, near the head), spawn/respawn at standing height\n- Ground-contact velocity reset + terminal clamp (prevents fall-speed accumulation)\n- Crosshair centered in CSS pixels (`window.innerWidth/Height`)\n\n**Verified:** lint + typecheck pass (exit 0), no raw GPU handles, no module-level side effects, scene252 correctly absent from `scene-config.json`/`bundle-size.spec.ts`, dev server on :5182 serving the latest code for all four modules.\n\n**Not verifiable here:** actual rendering/physics/gameplay — browser automation is blocked in this sandbox (Chrome SIGABRTs on crashpad's Mach bootstrap). I validated as deeply as the sandbox allows (lint/typecheck + full module-graph resolution through Vite).\n\n","timings":{"cache_n":67328,"draft_n":1904,"draft_n_accepted":634,"predicted_ms":20680.0,"predicted_n":906,"prompt_ms":1190.0,"prompt_n":411},"to_request":94095,"usage":{"cached_tokens":67328,"completion_tokens":906,"prompt_tokens":67739}}
