{"files":[{"bytes":9568,"media_type":"image/png","path":"files/91f746829784a04c5fac5f6ceb5a2f5dcb81233ae35365fd4c69ec746eaaecfc","sha256":"91f746829784a04c5fac5f6ceb5a2f5dcb81233ae35365fd4c69ec746eaaecfc"}],"kind":"ask","seq":99287,"t":5504997,"text":"Opened http://localhost:5182/lite/scene252.html (screenshot attached). It sits on the \"Initializing Babylon Lite\" spinner and never gets to the game — no terrain, no HUD. The console shows only \"Babylon Lite v0.1.0 - WebGPU engine\", no errors. Other gallery scenes render fine in the same browser.","turn":9}
