{"entry":{"id":"interview-t10-f133255-1","text":"gotcha: The recast emscripten glue's `instantiateAsync` only falls back to the ArrayBuffer path (`WebAssembly.instantiate`) inside a `catch` — if `WebAssembly.instantiateStreaming` *hangs* (never settles) rather than rejects, that fallback is unreachable — IMPLICATION: to force the non-streaming path I'd have to make streaming actively *reject* (monkey-patch `WebAssembly.instantiateStreaming`), since a plain hang can't be caught; parallel-loading the two modules is the cleaner alternative."},"fork":133255,"kind":"patch","op":"add","seq":134180,"t":7747891}
