24, launched bg_ec39a3f1 on :5182) — WHY: the long-running vite watcher serves stale transforms in this sandbox, so served code must match disk before the user reloads.\ninterview-t9-f114757-0\tconstraint: Navmesh dynamic obstacles require the tile-cache build path — `addBoxObstacle`/`addCylinderObstacle` throw (\"Navmesh has no tile cache\") unless `createNavMesh` is called with `maxObstacles > 0` (navigation.ts:697); scene252 must keep `maxObstacles: 64, tileSize: 32` or tile destruction crashes on the first shot.\ninterview-t9-f114757-1\tconstraint: The `console.warn` stage markers added to `main()` in scene252.ts are temporary instrumentation for diagnosing the init hang — they must be deleted once the stall is identified, per GUIDANCE §0b (no debug code in committed code).\nmechanical/.smoke-home\tfiles: .smoke-home\nmechanical/.smoke-tmp\tfiles: .smoke-tmp\nmechanical/.smoke-tmp/load-order.mjs\tfiles: .smoke-tmp/load-order.mjs\nmechanical/.smoke-tmp/served_recast.wasm\tfiles: .smoke-tmp/served_recast.wasm\nmechanical/~/diet-inference-runs/t1-phased-floor-2026-10-12-r3/background/shell-bg_08df777b.output\tfiles: ~/diet-inference-runs/t1-phased-floor-2026-10-12-r3/background/shell-bg_08df777b.output\nmechanical/~/diet-inference-runs/t1-phased-floor-2026-10-12-r3/background/shell-bg_a3fd11f4.output\tfiles: ~/diet-inference-runs/t1-phased-floor-2026-10-12-r3/background/shell-bg_a3fd11f4.output\nmechanical/~/diet-inference-runs/t1-phased-floor-2026-10-12-r3/background/shell-bg_e77f5316.output\tfiles: ~/diet-inference-runs/t1-phased-floor-2026-10-12-r3/background/shell-bg_e77f5316.output\nmechanical/~/diet-inference-runs/t1-phased-floor-2026-10-12-r3/background/shell-bg_ec39a3f1.output\tfiles: ~/diet-inference-runs/t1-phased-floor-2026-10-12-r3/background/shell-bg_ec39a3f1.output\nmechanical/~/git/reference/Babylon/Babylon-Lite/fps-smoke.cjs\tfiles: ~/git/reference/Babylon/Babylon-Lite/fps-smoke.cjs\nmechanical/~/git/reference/Babylon/Babylon-Lite/lab/lite/scene252.