{"entry":{"id":"interview-t12-f146677-0","text":"decision: Serve a production build (`vite build` → `vite preview`) on 5182 instead of the Vite dev server — WHY: the dev server's on-demand transforms are too slow for the browser's ~8s load window (scene2/scene40 also stall), while the pre-bundled static build loads fast."},"fork":146677,"kind":"patch","op":"add","seq":147455,"t":8908790}
{"entry":{"id":"interview-t12-f146677-1","text":"decision: Pass the preview port as `--port 5182 --strictPort` on the CLI — WHY: the lab's vite.config.ts only sets `server.port` (dev), not `preview.port`, so preview would otherwise default to 4173 and break the session's 5182 rule.\nDECISION (confirmed): the build emits lab scenes under `dist/lite/` (e.g. `dist/lite/scene252.html`), so the preview URL is `/lite/scene252.html` — WHY: `getHtmlInputs()` maps `lite/*.html` to `lite/<name>` rollup input keys, not flat names.\nDECISION (confirmed): the wasm + font assets (`HavokPhysics.wasm`, `recast-navigation.wasm`, `fonts/Inter.ttf`) are copied from `lab/public/` into `dist/` by Vite's default publicDir handling — WHY: so the static build serves them at the same root paths the scene code requests via `locateFile`, with no extra config."},"fork":146677,"kind":"patch","op":"add","seq":147456,"t":8908790}
