{"kind":"ask","seq":197946,"t":11930571,"text":"Results:\n- recast-test.html: \"module start\", \"core +20ms\", \"gens +28ms\", then nothing. Never reaches \"glue\".\n- two-wasm-test.html: recast-imports-start, recast-import-core, recast-import-gens, \"havok loaded +56ms\", then nothing.\n- I also tried the stock scene170.html (recast navigation demo): it sits on the spinner too.\nSo in my browser the recast glue import never finishes within the ~8 seconds I get per page, whatever page it's on, while Havok and everything else loads in well under 100 ms. I can't make my browser wait longer. Whatever you do, the game has to come up without that import stalling it.","turn":17}
